WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.889
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:05.569
No reenacting Pulp Fiction!

00:00:05.569 --> 00:00:10.420
Dr. Bright is strictly prohibited from reenacting
any of the scenes from the cult classic film

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.420
Pulp Fiction.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.580
Yes, even if you're in costume.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.450
Yes, that scene.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.440
Yep, that one too.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.440
Especially that one!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.710
None of this is work appropriate, even for
the SCP Foundation.

